00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:30.800
We will talk about a program called QuickBLASTP,
this is a program for rapidly finding high-scoring

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.970
matches in large databases.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.030
My name is Peter Cooper.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.190
