A reminder, here is the BLAST homepage.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:27.350
It has its own special URL, blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:28.929
And there is a help link at the top.

00:20:28.929 --> 00:20:34.019
It takes you to a page that has lots of documentation.

00:20:34.019 --> 00:20:41.539
There is a news feed and a mailing list that
you can subscribe to.

00:20:41.539 --> 00:20:45.000
Tao and I sit on the blast-help email aliase.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:48.980
You can write to us anytime you have a question.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:54.970
It is a good idea to send us your RID if you
have a problem so we can see what happened.

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:56.970
Here are additional links.

00:20:56.970 --> 00:21:03.740
There is a BLAST help book that has several
different parts including how to set up blast,

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:07.200
the standalone, command line manual.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:13.570
There are general things that you should know
about.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.929
We have a blog.

00:21:15.929 --> 00:21:18.049
We have a YouTube channel.

00:21:18.049 --> 00:21:26.460
We have a support center, you can go here
if you have a question and maybe you can find

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:27.460
the answer there.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:32.380
If you cannot, send us an email.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:35.779
There's also a set of factsheets on our ftp
site.

00:21:35.779 --> 00:21:37.679
Many of them are about BLAST.

00:21:37.679 --> 00:21:40.179
Tao is the major contributor to that.

00:21:40.179 --> 00:21:44.450
There are a lot of things about how to set
up BLAST.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:48.520
Let's see if that has finished.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:50.590
It is still running.

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:52.649
It just finished.

00:21:52.649 --> 00:21:56.820
It took about two minutes.

00:21:56.820 --> 00:22:01.000
That is all I have to talk about today.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.000
Any questions?

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.350
If you think of anything, please email us.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:12.789
If you have a question about the webinar program
in general, please write to, webinars@ncbi.nlm.nih.gov

00:22:12.789 --> 00:22:17.530
Thank you for coming.

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:19.590
We will see you next time.

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:19.700
&gt;&gt; [ Event concluded ]

